      <strong>{{ "Strategic analysis scope" if report_lang == "en" else "Contexto del análisis estratégico" }}:</strong>
      {{ "Declared-context coverage" if report_lang == "en" else "Cobertura del contexto declarado" }} {{ "%.1f"|format(strategic_basis.declared_context_coverage | default(0, true)) }}%.
      <br><span class="small">{{ "The declared profile guides collection and entity resolution. Calculations use current-run evidence only; the historical profile may be restored for an exact scope, but evidence and links are never copied." if report_lang == "en" else "El perfil declarado orienta la recolección y la resolución de entidades. Los cálculos usan únicamente evidencia de esta corrida; un alcance exacto puede recuperar el perfil histórico, pero nunca copia evidencias ni enlaces." }}</span>
    </div>
    <h3>Cyber-PESTEL · {{ "Cybersecurity macro-environmental pressures" if report_lang == "en" else "Presiones macroambientales de ciberseguridad" }}</h3>
    <p>{{ "The calculation operates on deduplicated public, corporate, regulatory, sector and news evidence clusters after entity resolution. Record volume does not multiply impact, evidence coverage is reported separately, and insufficient directional support produces a null pressure score." if report_lang == "en" else "El cálculo opera sobre clústeres deduplicados de evidencia pública, corporativa, regulatoria, sectorial y noticiosa después de resolver entidades. El volumen de registros no multiplica el impacto, la cobertura se reporta por separado y el soporte direccional insuficiente produce un puntaje de presión nulo." }}</p>
    <div class="kpi-grid compact">
      <div class="metric"><span>{{ "Related records" if report_lang == "en" else "Registros relacionados" }}</span><strong>{{ metrics.strategic_news.articles | length }}</strong></div>
      <div class="metric"><span>{{ "Clusters" if report_lang == "en" else "Clústeres" }}</span><strong>{{ metrics.strategic_news.clusters | length }}</strong></div>
      <div class="metric"><span>{{ "Rejected records" if report_lang == "en" else "Registros excluidos" }}</span><strong>{{ metrics.strategic_news.rejected_articles | length }}</strong></div>
      <div class="metric"><span>{{ "Contradictions" if report_lang == "en" else "Contradicciones" }}</span><strong>{{ metrics.strategic_news.contradictions | length }}</strong></div>
    </div>
    <div class="strategy-lens technical-strategy-lens">
      <article class="lens-block">
        <div>
          <span class="section-kicker">PESTEL</span>
          <h3>{% if metrics.pestel.signalScore is not none %}{{ "%.1f"|format(metrics.pestel.signalScore) }}/100{% else %}N/D{% endif %} · SignalScore</h3>
          <p><b>{{ "Evidence coverage" if report_lang == "en" else "Cobertura de evidencia" }}:</b> {{ format_strategic_percent((metrics.pestel.evidence_coverage_ratio | default(0, true)) * 100) }}</p>
          <p><b>{{ "Confidence" if report_lang == "en" else "Confianza" }}:</b> {{ "%.1f"|format(metrics.pestel.overall_confidence | default(0, true)) }}/100</p>
          <p class="small">{{ "A null pressure value means the evidence gates were not met; it does not mean zero pressure." if report_lang == "en" else "Una presión N/D indica que no se cumplieron las puertas de evidencia; no significa presión cero." }}</p>
        </div>
        <div class="evidence-table compact-table">
          <table>
            <tr><th>{{ "Dimension" if report_lang == "en" else "Dimensión" }}</th><th>{{ "Evidence coverage" if report_lang == "en" else "Cobertura" }}</th><th>{{ "Confidence" if report_lang == "en" else "Confianza" }}</th><th>{{ "Evidence mass" if report_lang == "en" else "Masa de evidencia" }}</th><th>{{ "Clusters / sources" if report_lang == "en" else "Clústeres / fuentes" }}</th><th>{{ "Pressure" if report_lang == "en" else "Presión" }}</th></tr>
            {% for item in metrics.pestel.dimensions %}
            <tr><td>{{ strategic_labels_en.get(item.key, item.name) if report_lang == "en" else pestel_labels_es.get(item.key, item.name) }}</td><td>{{ format_strategic_percent(item.evidence_coverage_percent | default(0, true)) }}</td><td>{{ "%.1f"|format(item.confidence | default(0, true)) }}/100</td><td>{{ "%.3f"|format(item.evidence_mass | default(0, true)) }}</td><td>{{ item.cluster_count | default(0) }} / {{ item.independent_source_count | default(0) }}</td><td>SignalScore {% if item.signalScore is not none %}{{ "%.1f"|format(item.signalScore) }}{% else %}N/D{% endif %} · {{ "validated" if report_lang == "en" else "validada" }} {% if item.validatedPressure is not none %}{{ "%.1f"|format(item.validatedPressure) }}{% else %}N/D{% endif %}</td></tr>
            {% endfor %}
          </table>
        </div>
      </article>
      <h3>Cyber-Porter · {{ "Competitive forces and sector cyber exposure" if report_lang == "en" else "Fuerzas competitivas y exposición cibernética sectorial" }}</h3>
      <article class="lens-block">
        <div>
          <span class="section-kicker">Porter</span>
          <h3>{% if metrics.porter.signalScore is not none %}{{ "%.1f"|format(metrics.porter.signalScore) }}/100{% else %}N/D{% endif %} · SignalScore</h3>
          <p><b>{{ "Evidence coverage" if report_lang == "en" else "Cobertura de evidencia" }}:</b> {{ format_strategic_percent((metrics.porter.evidence_coverage_ratio | default(0, true)) * 100) }}</p>
          <p><b>{{ "Confidence" if report_lang == "en" else "Confianza" }}:</b> {{ "%.1f"|format(metrics.porter.overall_confidence | default(0, true)) }}/100</p>
          <p class="small">{{ "A null pressure value means the evidence gates were not met; it does not mean zero pressure." if report_lang == "en" else "Una presión N/D indica que no se cumplieron las puertas de evidencia; no significa presión cero." }}</p>
        </div>
        <div class="evidence-table compact-table">
          <table>
            <tr><th>{{ "Force" if report_lang == "en" else "Fuerza" }}</th><th>{{ "Evidence coverage" if report_lang == "en" else "Cobertura" }}</th><th>{{ "Confidence" if report_lang == "en" else "Confianza" }}</th><th>{{ "Evidence mass" if report_lang == "en" else "Masa de evidencia" }}</th><th>{{ "Clusters / sources" if report_lang == "en" else "Clústeres / fuentes" }}</th><th>{{ "Pressure" if report_lang == "en" else "Presión" }}</th></tr>
            {% for item in metrics.porter.dimensions %}
            <tr><td>{{ strategic_labels_en.get(item.key, item.name) if report_lang == "en" else porter_labels_es.get(item.key, item.name) }}</td><td>{{ format_strategic_percent(item.evidence_coverage_percent | default(0, true)) }}</td><td>{{ "%.1f"|format(item.confidence | default(0, true)) }}/100</td><td>{{ "%.3f"|format(item.evidence_mass | default(0, true)) }}</td><td>{{ item.cluster_count | default(0) }} / {{ item.independent_source_count | default(0) }}</td><td>SignalScore {% if item.signalScore is not none %}{{ "%.1f"|format(item.signalScore) }}{% else %}N/D{% endif %} · {{ "validated" if report_lang == "en" else "validada" }} {% if item.validatedPressure is not none %}{{ "%.1f"|format(item.validatedPressure) }}{% else %}N/D{% endif %}</td></tr>
            {% endfor %}
          </table>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
    <h3>{{ "Integrated strategic matrix" if report_lang == "en" else "Matriz estratégica integrada" }}</h3>
